    text            : CTMS PowerTrials Integration- Billing Grid The enhanced integration of Oracle CTMS with PowerTrials addresses a key challenge in clinical research: ensuring accurate and timely billing for healthcare services and procedures conducted within research settings. • CTMS Guide Yes This release introduces new capabilities that empower hospitals and academic medical centers to manage charge sheets with greater precision, associating current procedure costs and assigning billing to the correct categories with ease. By leveraging the strengths of both systems, organizations can streamline study operations, eliminate redundant data entry, and provide seamless visibility to researchers, clinicians, and hospital administrators alike. Our mission is to reduce administrative burden so that healthcare professionals can focus less on systems and more on delivering exceptional patient care and advancing research. Training on this course will be available soon on Oracle University.
