    text            : Bug 36922460 introduced an issue where the Migration Application could not find the migration package. As a workaround for that bug, KB162087 on My Oracle Support suggested that the EAI Object Manager (or any clone that the Migration Application would use) should point its File System parameter to a local drive such as C:\fs. With bug 37510139, the issue has been fixed and if you have performed this configuration as a workaround undo it and restore the Object Manager’s File System parameter to a network drive.

