    text            : Default Speech-to-Text AI Service now uses the “Whisper” model From 24.10 onwards, the “Whisper” model is the default model for Speech- to-Text transcription. This is a change from the default in previous versions, which was the “Oracle Speech Model”. To revert to the “Oracle Speech Model”, modify the Business Component User Prop_modelType_to “ORACLE”.
