    text            : documentation in Siebel Bookshelf until it is available. Get Training on this feature here: Siebel CRM 2024 TOI: Web Tools Applet Format Toolbar <mark>UCM using This new feature for Siebel UCM takes advantage • Oracle Customer Yes</mark> Event Driven of the Siebel CRM Event Pub Sub framework for Hub (UCM) Master Architecture event-driven communications between Siebel Data Management CRM and external systems. Reference This allows event publishing to and consuming from Kafka for various use cases in a typical Siebel UCM implementation. Kafka is a distributed event store and streamprocessing platform used widely in the industry because it is scalable, fast, and fail-safe. By providing an integration with Kafka for Siebel UCM, integration and maintenance effort with external systems will be simplified.

