    text            : Siebel CRM Known Issues document the most current information on known product anomalies and workarounds (where available) for the Siebel CRM 26.2 Monthly Update. The information contained in the current version of the this document supersedes the content of all documentation provided with or for Siebel CRM Applications. It is important that you thoroughly review the Known Issues prior to the installation and use of the software to ensure a smooth installation and update process. For the legal notice applicable to Siebel CRM Known Issues (Release Notes), review: Oracle Release Notes Legal Notice (Doc ID 547098.1) .

