      - boundary_isolation: 1.00
      - repetition_support: 1.00
      - content_density: 0.20
    text            : If you do not use ADM in your migrations you will be unaffected by this situation.

  [ITEM 3] 26_2_update_logical_block_3204
    page            : 169
    confidence      : 0.70
    pattern         : pattern_007
